//github.com/Ascend/pytorch/actions/runs/32910396146","error_reason":"","env":"Python 3.10；PyTorch: b92213abd9；torch-npu: e3c387b3c0；CANN: Ascend-cann-A3_ops_9.1.0-beta.1；驱动: 25.5.1；机器: A3","torch_npu_sha":"e3c387b3c0","observed_at":1787796142.9012072}],"source_file":"analysis_2026-08-25_2026-08-26.json"},{"pr_number":194630,"pr_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/194630","title":"[inductor] Update dynamic vision_maskrcnn graph break baselines","commit_date":"2026-08-24","version":"2.15.0","module":"社区生态","impact_tag":"Monitor","priority":"low","status":"NATIVE_SUPPORTED","need_adaptation":"否","need_verification":"否","summary":"对齐 dynamic TorchBench 四份 graph break 基线中 vision_maskrcnn 的计数（推理 18→15、训练 38→33），修复 #185528 后基线未更新导致的 Inductor 周期任务反复失败。","impact_analysis":"此 PR 修改 Inductor 周期性基准的期望数据：将 benchmarks/dynamo/ci_expected_accuracy 下 4 份 dynamic TorchBench CSV（含 rocm 目录）中 vision_maskrcnn 的 graph break 数对齐 #185528 Dynamo 追踪收敛后的实际观测值（8 行纯数据行改动），check_graph_breaks.py 会拒绝优于基线的改善直到基线刷新，此前造成 periodic 反复红。对 vision_maskrcnn 与 ci_expected_accuracy 执行 git grep，torch_npu 仓内无匹配——torch_npu 的 Inductor 稳定性门禁使用自有用例集（torch_npu 仓 test/_inductor 目录），不复用上游 TorchBench graph break 基线文件。影响类型：纯 CI 期望值校准，无任何代码逻辑改动，不触及编译/运行时链路。验证方法：NPU 侧无需动作，常规回归 torch_npu test/_inductor/test_aclgraph_update_plan_compile.py 等自有用例即可。潜在风险：无，这些 CSV 仅被上游 dynamo 周期任务消费。","cann_dependency":"","ci_status":"是","ci_run_url":"https://github.com/Ascend/pytorch/actions/runs/32789792485","ci_error_reason":"","ci_env":"Python 3.10；PyTorch: 45592f388a；torch-npu: 488bc8066c；CANN: Ascend-cann-A3_ops_9.1.0-beta.1；驱动: 25.5.1；机器: A3","verification_history":[{"status":"是","run_url":"https://github.com/Ascend/pytorch/actions/runs/32789792485","error_reason":"","env":"Python 3.10；PyTorch: 45592f388a；torch-npu: 488bc8066c；CANN: Ascend-cann-A3_ops_9.1.0-beta.1；驱动: 25.5.1；机器: A3","torch_npu_sha":"488bc8066c","observed_at":1787731110.6841779}],"source_file":"analysis_2026-08-24_2026-08-25.json"},{"pr_number":194618,"pr_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/194618","title":"Fix Windows py3.15 builds: constrain Cython < 3.3.0 and bump the cp315 numpy pin","commit_date":"2026-08-24","version":"2.13.0","module":"社区生态","impact_tag":"Monitor","priority":"low","status":"PENDING_VERIFICATION","need_adaptation":"否","need_verification":"否","summary":"测试/CI 配置变更，不涉及核心代码，跳过 AI 分析。","impact_analysis":"测试/CI 变更，仅修改 .ci/，不涉及核心代码逻辑改动，不影响 torch-npu 功能。","cann_dependency":"","ci_status":"","ci_run_url":"","ci_error_reason":"","ci_env":"","verification_history":[],"source_file":"analysis_2026-08-24_2026-08-25.json"},{"pr_number":194610,"pr_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/194610","title":"Fix libtorch-extract being skipped on nightly-branch pushes","commit_date":"2026-08-24","version":"2.13.0","module":"社区生态","impact_tag":"Monitor","priority":"low","status":"PENDING_VERIFICATION","need_adaptation":"否","need_verification":"否","summary":"测试/CI 配置变更，不涉及核心代码，跳过 AI 分析。","impact_analysis":"测试/CI 变更，仅修改 .github/，不涉及核心代码逻辑改动，不影响 torch-npu 功能。","cann_dependency":"","ci_status":"","ci_run_url":"","ci_error_reason":"","ci_env":"","verification_history":[],"source_file":"analysis_2026-08-24_2026-08-25.json"},{"pr_number":194605,"pr_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/194605","title":"Clamp default num_threads to cpuset/affinity mask","commit_date":"2026-08-24","version":"2.15.0","module":"Core and API","impact_tag":"Monitor","priority":"medium","status":"PENDING_VERIFICATION","need_adaptation":"否","need_verification":"是","summary":"默认线程数推导改为受 CPU 亲和掩码（cpuset/taskset）钳制：TaskThreadPoolBase::defaultNumThreads 用 sched_getaffinity 的可用核数封顶，修复受限容器按宿主机核数起线程。","impact_analysis":"此 PR 修改 c10 基础运行时：c10/core/thread_pool.cpp 的 TaskThreadPoolBase::defaultNumThreads 新增 get_cpuset_num_threads（Linux 下 sched_getaffinity 统计进程可用 CPU 数），在 cpuinfo 拓扑结果与 hardware_concurrency 两条推导路径上都做钳制，修复 K8s cpuset/taskset 受限容器按宿主机核数起线程导致资源浪费甚至 libgomp 线程创建失败（51 行，含 .ci/pytorch/test.sh 的 taskset -c 0 回归断言）。对 defaultNumThreads 与 TaskThreadPool 执行 git grep，torch_npu 中仅 torch_npu/csrc/core/npu/NPUEventManager.cpp:10 以显式 5 线程构造 c10::TaskThreadPool，不调用默认线程数推导，事件管理线程池规模不变。影响类型：宿主侧 CPU intraop 线程池默认值行为变化，对 NPU 容器训练是正向修复——昇腾训练 Pod 常被 cpuset 限核，此前宿主核数级的 OpenMP 线程会挤占受限配额。验证方法：taskset -c 0 环境下 import torch_npu 后断言 torch.get_num_threads()==1，再跑 NPU 单机回归确认 host 侧回退算子吞吐无异常。潜在风险：绑定核数少的 Pod 上回退到 CPU 执行的算子并行度下降，属性能 trade-off 而非正确性问题。","cann_dependency":"","ci_status":"","ci_run_url":"","ci_error_reason":"","ci_env":"","verification_history":[],"source_file":"analysis_2026-08-24_2026-08-25.json"},{"pr_number":194555,"pr_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/194555","title":"[inductor] Fix FlexAttention autotuning with inlined captured buffers","commit_date":"2026-08-24","version":"2.15.0","module":"图模式","impact_tag":"Check","priority":"high","status":"NATIVE_SUPPORTED","need_adaptation":"是","need_verification":"是","summary":"修复 FlexAttention max-autotune 参数构造：改用模板 generate 记录的 choice.input_nodes 作为 autotune 输入，替代手工重建列表，消除捕获 buffer producer 被内联后 launcher 实参错位崩溃。","impact_analysis":"此 PR 修复 FlexAttention max-autotune 的参数构造：torch/_inductor/kernel/flex/flex_attention.py 与 flex_decoding.py 删除手工重建的 inputs_for_autotuning 列表，改用 TritonTemplate.generate 已记录在 choice.input_nodes 中的生成后真实依赖，修复 score_mod 捕获 buffer 的 gather producer 被内联进模板后 autotune 实参列表与生成 kernel ABI 错位（launcher 缺 _grid_2 的 TypeError，79 行，31 行为参数化回归）。耦合链路：torch_npu/_inductor/kernel/flex_attention.py:1138 仍保留被上游删除的 inputs_for_autotuning 重建逻辑（input_nodes + score_mod_other_buffers + mask_mod_other_buffers 拼接），:1149 将其喂给 autotune_select_algorithm——NPU 移植版基于旧版上游 flex_attention，当 NPU 模板 codegen 同样把捕获 buffer 的间接 gather producer 内联进 Triton 模板时，autotune 输入列表与生成 kernel 实参不一致的同类崩溃会在 NPU max-autotune 路径复现。影响类型：编译期崩溃（显性异常而非数值错误），触发条件为 max-autotune 加相对位置偏置经 gather 产生的 score_mod 捕获。验证方法：在 NPU 上以 mode=\"max-autotune\" 运行上游新增回归 test_max_autotune_with_gathered_captured_buffer 的等价场景，走 torch_npu/_inductor/kernel/flex_attention.py 对应路径确认参数构造一致。潜在风险：不移植修复则 NPU FlexAttention max-autotune 对该类捕获模式直接抛 launcher 参数缺失异常；修复动作是纯 Python 层对齐 choice.input_nodes 用法，属 torch_npu 仓内插件层变更。","cann_dependency":"否","ci_status":"是","ci_run_url":"https://github.com/Ascend/pytorch/actions/runs/32770520747","ci_error_reason":"","ci_env":"Python 3.10；PyTorch: 142552d4b1；torch-npu: 488bc8066c；CANN: Ascend-cann-A3_ops_9.1.0-beta.1；驱动: 25.5.1；机器: A3","verification_history":[{"status":"是","run_url":"https://github.com/Ascend/pytorch/actions/runs/32770520747","error_reason":"","env":"Python 3.10；PyTorch: 142552d4b1；torch-npu: 488bc8066c；CANN: Ascend-cann-A3_ops_9.1.0-beta.1；驱动: 25.5.1；机器: A3","torch_npu_sha":"488bc8066c","observed_at":1787731110.6841779}],"source_file":"analysis_2026-08-24_2026-08-25.json"},{"pr_number":194552,"pr_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/194552","title":"[vllm hash update] update the pinned vllm hash","commit_date":"2026-08-24","version":"2.13.0","module":"社区生态","impact_tag":"Monitor","priority":"low","status":"NATIVE_SUPPORTED","need_adaptation":"否","need_verification":"否","summary":"测试/CI 配置变更，不涉及核心代码，跳过 AI 分析。","impact_analysis":"测试/CI 变更，仅修改 .github/，不涉及核心代码逻辑改动，不影响 torch-npu 功能。","cann_dependency":"","ci_status":"是","ci_run_url":"https://github.com/Ascend/pytorch/actions/runs/32689818755","ci_error_reason":"","ci_env":"Python 3.10；PyTorch: d1cbd4bd98；torch-npu: 8057a82459；CANN: Ascend-cann-A3_ops_9.1.0-beta.1；驱动: 25.5.1；机器: A3","verification_history":[{"status":"是","run_url":"https://github.com/Ascend/pytorch/actions/runs/32689818755","error_reason":"","env":"Python 3.10；PyTorch: d1cbd4bd98；torch-npu: 8057a82459；CANN: Ascend-cann-A3_ops_9.1.0-beta.1；驱动: 25.5.1；机器: A3","torch_npu_sha":"8057a82459","observed_at":1787621229.640396}],"source_file":"analysis_2026-08-23_2026-08-24.json"},{"pr_number":194551,"pr_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/194551","title":"[torchcomms hash update] update the pinned torchcomms hash","commit_date":"2026-08-24","version":"2.13.0","module":"社区生态","impact_tag":"Monitor"